# Kept out of the Vercel upload.
#
# server.js is the local dev entry point and it calls server.listen() at module scope. Vercel's zero-config
# Node detection treats a root-level `server.js` as THE server entrypoint and routes every request to it,
# which would bypass api/signaling.js and the per-function maxDuration in vercel.json. It must not be uploaded.
server.js

# Local-only.
test/
node_modules/
README.md
